  "description": "Amplify your trail-game with the Fourstroke AMP LT TWO, built to perform on every terrain. This advanced XC performance machine delivers a progressive riding feel with 120 mm of revolutionized APS dual-link suspension travel. Hidden trail-racing power comes curtesy of the trailblazing TQ-HPR50 drive system for nonstop uphill and downhill speed to make sure nothing stands in your way. The full-carbon frame includes our most progressive geometry to accommodate two water bottles, an integrated fork stopper and frame protection. Fourstroke AMP LT TWO allows you to charge the trails with a SRAM GX Eagle drivetrain, RockShox SID Select+ 3P fork and RockShox SIDLuxe Select+ 3P shock, a DT Swiss M 1900 wheelset with 30 mm inner width and the powerful TQ-HPR50 drive unit.",
